 "notes": "TfNSW plan T6-232-2n (Roads & Maritime 2019 sheet): width marker panel for truck-mounted linemarking vehicles (behind the rear-vision mirror), 140 x 400, R25, double sided, hinged to the vehicle; white with black 45-degree stripes and a thin black outline as the sheet draws it (keyline). Stripes from the stripe detail (48 / 57 / 57 square to the stripes from the upper outer corner): the corner band is black to 105 (48 + 57, as drawn), then 57 white / 57 black alternately. The sheet draws an OFF SIDE pair and a NEAR SIDE pair (mirror images); (R) is the off-side (driver's side) panel as dimensioned, stripes falling to the left, and (L) the near-side panel, its mirror image. The mounting brackets, mirror and mudguard outlines on the sheet are not part of the marker."
